%N A398942 Decimal expansion of the height of a canonical (dual-uniform) 10-gonal trapezohedron with unit short edge length.
%C A398942 The 10-gonal trapezohedron is the dual polyhedron of the 10-gonal antiprism.
%H A398942 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A398942/b398942.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 2..10000</a>
