%F A398942 Equals cot(Pi/20)*csc(Pi/20)/2 = A019979*csc(Pi/20)/2.
%F A398942 Equals (sqrt(5) - 1)*(csc(Pi/20)^3)/16 = A134972*(csc(Pi/20)^3)/16.
%F A398942 Equals the largest root of x^8 - 412*x^6 + 1939*x^4 - 168*x^2 + 1.
